<aside class="about">
    <p>
        <strong>himmelszelt</strong> is a family of small TypeScript + WebGPU libraries for rendering the sky, day and
        night: where the Sun, the Moon, and the stars are, how the atmosphere scatters their light, and the maps,
        look-up tables, and image-based lighting a renderer needs for all of it. Each one drops into an existing
        renderer, and none of them hard-depends on another. <a href={`${base}/#about`}>More about himmelszelt</a>.
    </p>
</aside>
